## SQ-CDV-01 | devtools loads
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -E "\[creativedevtools\]\|creativedevtools" logs/latest.log \| head`; `grep -E "\[creativedevtools\]" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log`
@pass `[creativedevtools] loaded, members: [cdevperfbot, cdevcapture]` with no `NOT loaded`; startup log `[creativedevtools] core finished`; server log `[creativedevtools] server scripts ready`; no ERROR naming creativedevtools; `config/creativedevtools-common.toml` has `[debug.*]`, `[worldgen.mass_place]`, `[features]`, and the CE toml lost `[debug]` and `[worldgen.mass_place]` after Forge's correction
@fails patcherMod jar older than the hooks (NoClassDefFoundError `BlockStateLookupHook`), or the script trees missing from the jar
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb
bootexpect \[creativedevtools\] loaded, members: \[ceperfbot, cecapture\]
bootreject \[creativedevtools\].*NOT loaded
bootreject NoClassDefFoundError.*(BlockStateLookupHook|LevelRandomHook)
kjsexpect \[creativedevtools\] server scripts ready
shell grep -E "\[creativedevtools\]" logs/kubejs/startup.log; grep -E "ERROR.*creativedevtools" logs/latest.log | head -5; grep -nE "^\s*\[" config/creativedevtools-common.toml; echo CE:; grep -nE "^\s*\[(debug|worldgen\.mass_place)" config/creativeengineering-common.toml || echo "CE has no debug/mass_place"
look startup core finished; toml has [debug.*], [worldgen.mass_place], [features]; CE toml lost [debug] and [worldgen.mass_place]

## SQ-CDV-02 | devtools commands answer
@group A
@commands `/cdevgen list`; `/cdevperf status`; `/cdevplace status`; `/recipescan`; `/dumpworldjei`; `/dumpspawns`; `/flowerworld` is in tab completion (do not run it in a shared world)
@pass Each command answers (no "Unknown command"); `/recipescan` prints its summary line; `/dumpspawns` writes `kubejs/exported/spawns.json`
@fails A script without `global.CDV`, or `SpawnDump` class name not updated in `dump_spawns.js`
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb
> cegen list
> ceperf status
> ceplace status
> recipescan
waitlog (?i)(recipescan|recipe scan).*(done|summary|checked|recipes|references) 300
> dumpworldjei
sleep 10
> dumpspawns
sleep 10
reject Unknown command
shell ls -la kubejs/exported/spawns.json; grep -rn "flowerworld" kubejs/server_scripts logs/kubejs/server.log | head -3
look every command answered; /recipescan summary line; spawns.json written now; /flowerworld registered (not run)

## SQ-CDV-03 | /dumpall (about 5 min)
@group A
@commands `/dumpall` (about 5 min, includes dumpclimate); then `grep -E "ReferenceError\|guardThrowable\|writeExportJson" logs/kubejs/server.log`
@pass `[dumpall] all 25 dumps done`; no ReferenceError: the Devtools wrappers reach `global.guardThrowable` / `global.writeExportJson` from the pack's `_lib`
@fails `java_guard.js` / `export_io.js` not exporting their globals
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb passed
> dumpall
waitlog \[dumpall\] (all \d+ dumps done|\d+/\d+ (dumps )?ok) 900
expect \[dumpall\] (all 25 dumps done|2[45]/25 (dumps )?ok)
kjsreject ReferenceError
kjsreject guardThrowable.*(not|undefined)|writeExportJson.*(not|undefined)

> save-all flush
sleep 5

## SQ-CDV-04 | devtools test recipes under the creativedevtools namespace (probe half in cs1b)
@group A
@commands `/dumprecipes create`, then `grep -rho "creativedevtools:[^\"]*" kubejs/exported/recipes/ \| sort -u \| head`; set `[debug.level_random] probe = true`, restart, `grep LevelRandomProbe logs/latest.log`; set it back to false
@pass The test recipes are listed under `creativedevtools:` ids (one `*_mech_crafting` per metal and wood, netherite, one sequenced assembly); with the probe on the world loads, and only `[LevelRandomProbe] off-thread` WARN lines (or none) appear
@fails Recipes still under `creativeengineering:` (NCH namespace not switched), or the probe factory not registered on the hook
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb
> dumprecipes create
sleep 20
shell grep -rho "creativedevtools:[^\"]*" kubejs/exported/recipes/ | sort -u | head -30
look one *_mech_crafting per metal and wood, netherite, one sequenced assembly, all creativedevtools:
